    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ROSE: I put in an extra scoop for my favorite client.\nEVA: Thanks, Rose.\nROSE: I’m sure she won’t be long.\nEVA: You clearly don’t know my mother very well.",
      "EVA: Go kiss a pig.\nSCARLET: Close your eyes, baby girl.\nEVA: Mom, stop!\nEVA: Stop!",
      "ROSE: Evening, sugar. Can I lighten your load?\nEVA: Yes, of course.\nROSE: Sit anywhere, sweetie. I’ll bring you your usual.\nROSE: An extra scoop for my favorite client.",
      "MADELEINE: Hello dear, what can I do you for?\nEVA: I need to exchange some books.\nMADELEINE: Well, that’s nice. Not a lot of people your age read these days. Do you have a card with us?\nEVA: No. But I’d like to open one.",
      "MADELEINE: Anna may, this lovely young lady wants to open a card with us.\nANNA MAY: Well, Madeleine should have known we don’t take new readers without a reference.\nMADELEINE: I had a hunch.\nANNA MAY: Fudge your hunches, if you pardon my french. Florence dear, will you join us?"
    ]
  },
